1
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,480
Until one day,

2
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:08,039
I ran into his son eloping with his lover.

3
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:11,280
I can only blame how much the father and son look alike.

4
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,640
So I

5
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,250
couldn't hold back.

6
00:01:20,039 --> 00:01:21,440
I was stunned at the time.

7
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,640
Having just regained my memory,

8
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,920
I was at a loss.

9
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,280
Who are they?

10
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:39,039
What did you do?

11
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,200
Lao San.

12
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,920
I remember now.

13
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,050
I thought it was him.

14
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,560
It must be his son.

15
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:48,280
What should I do? I killed them.

16
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,759
It's fine.

17
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:54,039
Leave it to me.

18
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,920
Lao San sewed the bodies with red thread

19
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,680
to cover up the marks from my axe,

20
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,050
creating the illusion of the Red Lady's revenge.

21
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,400
Then overnight,

22
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,480
hung it on the intertwined branches at Tongxin Cliff,

23
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,000
making everyone believe

24
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,730
that the vengeful spirit of Hong Niangzi had returned for revenge.

25
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,960
Wu Laosan thought we could get away with it,

26
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,400
but as I remembered everything,

27
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,000
I gradually lost control.

28
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,340
I couldn't suppress the resentment in my heart.

29
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,560
So,

30
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,560
I disguised myself as a servant

31
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,280
and sneaked into the Chen Manor.

32
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,840
Seeing the luxurious life in the Chen Manor,

33
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,240
I became even angrier.

34
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,560
I couldn't think of how to take revenge for a moment,

35
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,400
until

36
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,730
I heard the news that Chen still had descendants.

37
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,400
I decided

38
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,400
to end their bloodline.

39
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:45,120
Chen Sheng,

40
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,120
you were heartless and unfaithful,

41
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,120
and your son is also a debauchee.

42
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,440
I will not allow the world

43
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,640
to have another pitiful person like me.

44
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,000
Ending your bloodline, Chen Sheng,

45
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:56,400
means

46
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,440
we are even.

47
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:14,020
Wu Laosan tried to stop me,

48
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,280
but he was too late.

49
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,360
I'm sorry.

50
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,240
I couldn't control myself.

51
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,400
So,

52
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,930
he decided to repeat his old trick,

53
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,520
making all of this

54
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,160
look like the murders by Hong Niangzi.

55
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,400
I will handle this.

56
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,520
Whatever you do,

57
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,560
don't go home.

58
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,000
Then I'll go to the Marriage Shrine

59
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,930
and wait for you.

60
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,280
You must come.

61
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,000
You must come.

62
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,120
You must come.

63
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,240
The third son's behavior

64
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,210
was terrifying in the maid's eyes.

65
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,280
In your eyes,

66
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,000
it was suspicious.

67
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,840
But in my eyes,

68
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,560
it was touching.

69
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,240
Then why did the candlestick

70
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,160
happen to ignite the red string?

71
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,360
I am going to the Matchmaker Shrine.

72
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,480
You must come.

73
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,600
You must come.

74
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:22,240
So I waited and waited.

75
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,400
I waited until dawn,

76
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,720
but he never came.

77
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,600
My hair turned white overnight,

78
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:33,040
only to wait for his dead body.

79
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,920
Lord Su,

80
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,480
Mr. Shen,

81
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,840
you guys are amazing.

82
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:50,720
You don't believe the story of the Red Lady is true.

83
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,360
The third son

84
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,360
also worried that you would find me.

85
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,400
So

86
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,930
he took the blame for everything on my behalf.

87
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,600
Is anyone there?

88
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,920
Mr. Shen.

89
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,360
Lord Su.

90
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,450
Since you are both here,

91
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,040
please be our witnesses.

92
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,360
Lao San.

93
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,130
For all these years,

94
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,980
we never formally bowed in marriage.

95
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,159
I will make it up to you today.

96
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,720
It's all my fault

97
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,520
for clinging to the wrong person

98
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,560
for so long.

99
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,240
I owe you in this life.

100
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,160
In the next life,

101
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,690
and the life after that,

102
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,600
I will be your wife,

103
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,240
never to be separated.

104
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:24,090
With the Matchmaker as my witness,

105
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,120
this is my vow.

106
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,360
What could

107
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,120
make a person

108
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,120
do such a thing?

109
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,160
Perhaps

110
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,560
it's because of love.

111
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,170
Hurry! The murderer is inside.

112
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:37,240
Why didn't you misunderstand me like the rest of them?

113
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,720
Because the first time I saw you,

114
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,640
I knew

115
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,480
a woman so determined and impartial in her investigations

116
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,840
could never be

117
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,360
the shameless person they made you out to be.

118
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:48,020
Thank you for believing in me.

119
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:49,720
By the way,

120
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,240
I forgot to ask,

121
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,240
where do you live?

122
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,840
I live at my uncle's house.

123
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,120
Right.

124
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,500
I'll head back to the county office then.

125
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,240
See you tomorrow.

126
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,000
See you tomorrow.

127
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,360
See you tomorrow.

128
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,000
Are you dizzy from exhaustion?

129
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,260
Doesn't the magistrate live over there?

130
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,200
I'm just too tired.

131
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,780
Good night.

132
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,380
Good night.

133
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,920
Are you returning to the manor, Your Highness?

134
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,840
The Prince of Ling has returned!

135
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,480
You're back.

136
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,840
You must be tired from investigating.

137
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,240
It's fine. I'm not tired.

138
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,520
Is it really appropriate for you

139
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,000
to lower yourself by staying at the county office?

140
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,600
It's fine.

141
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,500
I just arrived anyway.

142
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,120
Working on cases with them

143
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,240
helps me get familiar with the area.

144
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,360
I'm scared of him.

145
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:49,120
My mother was very formidable in Chang'an.

146
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:51,360
Having a Prince of Ling in Fangzhou

147
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,200
who cares so deeply for the country and its people

148
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,600
must make the Empress Dowager very happy.

149
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,200
Not at all.

150
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,240
It's all thanks to the county office's efficiency.

151
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:59,320
Although Lord Su is clever,

152
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,960
investigating cases is dangerous.

153
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,240
Please be careful, Your Highness.

154
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,900
I'm a little tired.

155
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,120
You may all leave.

156
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,640
I made your favorite roast chicken.

157
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,120
No need.

158
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,200
I want to be alone for a while.
